        <p class="hint">支持 ${_d(a0_0x104f1d(0x3983,'\x21\x57\x67\x55')+a0_0x104f1d(0x358f,'\x34\x79\x23\x76'))}://（可带 user:pass@）、http(s)://、${_d(a0_0x104f1d(0x22a7,'\x32\x57\x4e\x72')+a0_0x104f1d(0x2f6,'\x41\x58\x45\x68'))} 或 host:port（默认按 ${_d(a0_0x104f1d(0x2375,'\x32\x6b\x37\x73')+a0_0x104f1d(0x14d6,'\x24\x5b\x26\x56'))}，端口 1080）。此项控制 Worker 的真实转发出口，不会作为节点字段写进订阅；验证出口 IP 时请选择“仅走出口（only）”，默认模式在代理失败时会回退直连。SS 加密支持 ${_d('\x59\x57\x56\x7a\x4c'+a0_0x104f1d(0x2582,'\x21\x57\x67\x55')+a0_0x104f1d(0x39c,'\x44\x65\x35\x5d')+'\x3d')} / ${_d(a0_0x104f1d(0x12c5,'\x4f\x55\x71\x5d')+a0_0x104f1d(0x3088,'\x42\x26\x72\x21')+a0_0x104f1d(0x461,'\x48\x67\x77\x5d')+'\x3d')} / ${_d(a0_0x104f1d(0x22e,'\x49\x42\x75\x38')+a0_0x104f1d(0x2317,'\x76\x68\x73\x2a')+'\x41\x3d')}-ietf-poly1305。</p>
